 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.1",
   "range": "2CH.8.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2af3b7c9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.1#p1-2af3b7c9",
     "text": "Signifying that he was 20 years in building them.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "twenty years"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.2",
   "range": "2CH.8.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "37fb076e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.2#p1-37fb076e",
     "text": "That is, which Hiram gave again to Solomon because they did not please him and therefore called them Cabul, that is, dirt or filth, 1Ki 9:13.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "restored to Solomon",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 9:13",
       "ref": "1KI.9.13"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.4",
   "range": "2CH.8.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "facfaeba",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.4#p1-facfaeba",
     "text": "Meaning of munitions and treasures for the war.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "store cities"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.5",
   "range": "2CH.8.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6e7166c8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.5#p1-6e7166c8",
     "text": "That is, he repaired and fortified them, for they were built long before by Sherah a noble woman of the tribe of Ephraim, 1Ch 6:68,7:24.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "Bethhoron the upper",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:68,7:24",
       "ref": "1CH.6.68"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:68,7:24",
       "ref": "1CH.7.24"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.10",
   "range": "2CH.8.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d8fd4938",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.10#p1-d8fd4938",
     "text": "For in all there were 3300 but here he means of them who had the principal charge, 1Ki 9:23.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "two hundred and fifty",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 9:23",
       "ref": "1KI.9.23"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.13",
   "range": "2CH.8.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "40ef1cf6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.13#p1-40ef1cf6",
     "text": "Read Le 23:1-44.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "three times in the year",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Le 23:1-44",
       "ref": "LEV.23.1-44"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.16",
   "range": "2CH.8.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "98193120",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.16#p1-98193120",
     "text": "Both for the matte and also for the workmanship.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "work of Solomon was prepared unto"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.17",
   "range": "2CH.8.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8739bef7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.17#p1-8739bef7",
     "text": "Meaning, the Red Sea.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "sea side in the land of"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2CH.8.18",
   "range": "2CH.8.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fde57f6b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2CH.8.18#p1-fde57f6b",
     "text": "Which is thought to amount to 3,600,000 crowns, for here mention is made of 30 more than are spoken of, 1Ki 9:28.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "four hundred and fifty talents of",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 9:28",
       "ref": "1KI.9.28"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
